Final Business Impact

This project transformed raw transactional sales data into a comprehensive business intelligence solution by analyzing customer behavior, market performance, product profitability, revenue trends, and operational efficiency. The analysis identified revenue concentration risks, profitability challenges, data quality issues, seasonal sales patterns, and high-value business opportunities, providing actionable recommendations to support strategic decision-making in sales, inventory planning, and supply chain operations.
